      "role": "user",
      "content": "i cant even look at my phone anymore. everything i built is just... gone. one day i had a life and a reputation and now i'm just waiting for the house to be taken and the emails to start coming in from people asking how i could be so stupid. it feels like i'm just falling and there's no way to stop the impact.",
